00:15:40,980 --> 00:15:45,320
This individual possesses an ancient
power stronger than any I've seen.

260
00:15:45,540 --> 00:15:46,660
And his name?

261
00:15:46,900 --> 00:15:48,020
His darts.

262
00:15:48,820 --> 00:15:49,880
Who's darts?

263
00:15:50,020 --> 00:15:50,961
Who cares, Yugi?

264
00:15:51,400 --> 00:15:52,620
You're in danger.

265
00:15:53,060 --> 00:15:56,060
Darts plans to use my game
to destroy civilization.

266
00:15:56,220 --> 00:15:57,940
He must be stopped.

267
00:15:58,160 --> 00:16:01,660
And the key to taking him down
is somewhere in this room.

268
00:16:04,940 --> 00:16:08,940
Ever since my retirement began,
I've had a lot of time on my hands.

269
00:16:09,160 --> 00:16:13,984
So I began to further my studies of the
ancient Egyptian origins of dual monsters.

270
00:16:14,220 --> 00:16:16,620
And I made an astonishing discovery.

271
00:16:16,960 --> 00:16:20,784
These creatures existed long before
the pyramids were even built.

272
00:16:20,940 --> 00:16:22,560
In the city of Atlantis.

273
00:16:23,080 --> 00:16:26,040
And that is where this
Dart character comes in.

274
00:16:26,260 --> 00:16:30,940
He's trying to resurrect the most
terrifying beast ever to roam the Earth.

275
00:16:31,080 --> 00:16:32,757
The Great Leviathan.

276
00:16:32,840 --> 00:16:36,497
By draining the souls of
man and beast In order to

277
00:16:36,580 --> 00:16:39,462
build up the strength of
this unstoppable monster

278
00:16:40,200 --> 00:16:41,030
Yes,

279
00:16:41,113 --> 00:16:46,857
of course The age of destruction is here
The earth shall be shrouded in darkness And

280
00:16:46,940 --> 00:16:49,437
your very soul shall fuel the force that

281
00:16:49,520 --> 00:16:52,760
devastates mankind What
do you mean by that?

282
00:16:53,460 --> 00:16:56,557
A great beast is now
awakening from its ancient

283
00:16:56,640 --> 00:17:00,180
slumber To complete what
it began centuries ago No,

284
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:01,800
but before it can arise,

285
00:17:02,080 --> 00:17:04,100
it must feast upon enough souls.

286
00:17:05,300 --> 00:17:07,000
If his plan works,

287
00:17:07,500 --> 00:17:11,382
darts will have succeeded in
unleashing a truly devastating power,

288
00:17:11,860 --> 00:17:15,560
the likes of which have not
been seen for 10,000 years.

289
00:17:16,500 --> 00:17:22,000
You're our only hope, so I've created an
exclusive card just for you, Yugi boy.

290
00:17:22,340 --> 00:17:23,170
No way!

291
00:17:25,200 --> 00:17:28,717
I've hidden this one-of-a-kind
card somewhere in this room.

292
00:17:28,800 --> 00:17:30,420
Think strategically now.

293
00:17:30,720 --> 00:17:33,460
Where can one find an extra card?

294
00:17:34,360 --> 00:17:35,440
Pot of greed!

295
00:17:35,820 --> 00:17:39,520
In the game of duel monsters,
that lets you draw extra cards.

296
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:40,640
Come to papa!

297
00:17:47,620 --> 00:17:50,000
Oh, real special card.

298
00:17:50,340 --> 00:17:52,800
This thing's completely blank, guys.

299
00:17:53,260 --> 00:17:54,460
Then it's worthless.

300
00:17:55,400 --> 00:17:56,760
Not necessarily.

301
00:17:57,160 --> 00:17:58,480
Time is running out.

302
00:17:59,820 --> 00:18:01,717
My cute little duel monsters.

303
00:18:01,800 --> 00:18:05,060
Soon they'll be gone, along
with the rest of the world.

304
00:18:05,740 --> 00:18:09,780
Only you can save the poor
creatures that made my game famous.

305
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:14,140
Whoa, talk about drama.

306
00:18:15,260 --> 00:18:17,820
Aw, man, this can't be happening.

307
00:18:18,340 --> 00:18:21,105
Why would Mai join a plot
to destroy the world?

308
00:18:21,320 --> 00:18:24,320
I'm telling you, they
brainwashed her or something.

309
00:18:24,620 --> 00:18:27,140
Why don't you all wake up? Huh?

310
00:18:27,800 --> 00:18:29,140
This is a hoax.

311
00:18:29,540 --> 00:18:31,280
All designed by Pegasus.

312
00:18:31,460 --> 00:18:33,617
There's no one traveling around stealing

313
00:18:33,700 --> 00:18:36,420
people's souls with
some magic playing card.

314
00:18:36,940 --> 00:18:40,580
It's the same nonsense Pegasus
pulled in Duelist Kingdom.

315
00:18:42,020 --> 00:18:43,057
Think about it!

316
00:18:43,140 --> 00:18:47,260
He's trying to distract me long
enough for him to take over Kaivocorm!

317
00:18:47,500 --> 00:18:48,330
That's enough!

318
00:18:48,640 --> 00:18:49,920
You should wake up!

319
00:18:50,200 --> 00:18:52,020
It's not always about you.

320
00:18:52,320 --> 00:18:56,908
There's something going on here that's
bigger than all of us, and you know it.

321
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:01,617
Ah, that card.

322
00:19:01,700 --> 00:19:03,280
Where did you get it?

323
00:19:05,140 --> 00:19:06,740
Same place I did.

324
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:11,040
Kaiba, you have one of
these, too, don't you?

325
00:19:15,320 --> 00:19:17,120
You're referring to this?

326
00:19:24,420 --> 00:19:26,920
Yeah, nothing magic going on here.

327
00:19:27,140 --> 00:19:29,817
I believe the only way
to defeat this great

328
00:19:29,900 --> 00:19:32,700
Leviathan is to use these
three cards together.

329
00:19:33,220 --> 00:19:36,280
So trust what's inside
your heart and join us.
